    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "L2 · Synthesis",
      "items": [
        "Consumes models only — no component here invokes a C front-end directly.",
        "CMP-TCM is the hub: both producers read and write it rather than each other."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Two producers, one store",
      "items": [
        "CMP-ATG derives cases automatically; CMP-GEN renders them into framework source.",
        "Every L2 component depends on CMP-ANA for the analysis model and on CMP-CORE for platform services."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Cross-cutting",
      "items": [
        "CMP-GEN → CMP-PLG is the one upward edge, legal only because CMP-PLG is cross_cutting.",
        "It is how a third-party test framework back-end plugs into generation."
      ]
    }
